  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow hits low, between navel and groin. You’re horrified to see urine start trickling down the shaft. Your bladder was just pierced! A faint unmistakable reek reaches your nostrils as you realize what has just happened.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2). Fortunately for you, urine is mostly sterile so you only contract a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.1hQuVFZt9QnnbWzg]{Minor Infection}. Also, until the wound has closed in a week or so you are prone to leaking, which reduces your Fellowship by -10 whenever you are near anyone with a sense of smell. </p><p><strong>Surgery (Difficult)</strong> will be required for Extraction, and as long as the arrow remains you’ll suffer a penalty of -10 to any Endurance Tests required by the Infection.</p>"
    },
